a vast experience of offering Edexcel BTEC courses at Level 4, Level 5
and Level 7 to the students worldwide.  Besides offering Edexcel BTEC
Level 4, Level 5 and Level 7 one-year courses, OCL also offers Level 1,
Level 2 and Level 3 Edexcel qualifications in various specialities.  The
complete list of our courses offered via e-learning can be viewed at
http://www.ocl.ac/e-learning-courses.html

These qualifications will equip your employees with the necessary
managerial and business skills required by the employers.  Depending on
what skills you want your employees to achieve, our wide range of courses
will enable your employees to think strategically and excel in the area
they function.  These qualifications / diplomas will provide your
employees with the skills to comprehend the theoretical concepts, analyse
them, relate and apply these concepts to real-life situations and
synthesize a new process to be implemented.

Your employees can achieve these qualifications via e-learning.  This
means they do not have to be off from the work to study and can acquire
these skills while working.  Your employees will be able to keep balance
between learning and working.  By learning while working, employees can
apply their knowledge at their work place and strive to improvise their
functions and enhance their creativity. 

Edexcel is the UKs largest awarding body and provides academic and
vocational qualifications and testing to more than 25000 schools,
colleges, employers worldwide.  Edexcels qualifications are more
practical oriented.  These qualifications will equip your employees with
the skills to be creative, imaginative, innovative, critical thinkers,
reflective learners, and independent enquirers. 

All our tutors are qualified and appropriately screened by Edexcel.  They
have several years of experience of delivering edexcel courses.  Your
employees would be in continuous communication with our tutors.  Our tutors
will guide your employees through the course material, set and mark their
work and provide constructive feedback on their progress.

Your employees would also be able to access online chat rooms, in-built
into our virtual learning management system, where they can easily
communicate to their tutors.  They would also be able to leave their
messages online to receive their responses. 

Our stimulating lecture materials and prompt feedback time from our
tutors will encourage your staff to be committed to their studies. 

The courses we offer will add value to your organisation by equipping
your staff with:

7 The ability to manage themselves, others and practices within the
sector they are working or planning to work

7 The ability to analyse, synthesise and summarise information critically

7 The ability to read and use appropriate literature with a full and
critical understanding

7 The ability to think independently and solve problems

7 The ability to apply subject knowledge and understanding to address
familiar and unfamiliar problems

7 The capacity to give a clear and accurate account of a subject,
assemble arguments in a mature way and engage in a debate and dialogue
both with specialists and non-specialists.

OCLs online-study pathways
Students can pursue any one of the following options:

Course pathway for Bachelors programme
Employees who have already achieved A-Level / Intermediate or any other
Level 3 qualification can enrol with us for Edexcel BTEC Level 4 Higher
National Certificate and Edexcel BTEC Level 5 Higher National Diploma
courses.  Each course is of one year in duration.

Students can opt for Top-up Bachelors (final year of British graduation)
after studying Edexcel BTEC level 5 Higher National Diploma online with
us. 

After finishing Edexcel BTEC Level 4 Higher National Certificate and
Edexcel BTEC Level 5 Higher National Diploma courses, which is equivalent
to the first and second year of British undergraduate degree, students
can also proceed directly to study for Edexcel BTEC Level 7 Extended
Diploma in Strategic Management and Leadership which leads to British
post-graduate qualification. Edexcel BTEC Level 7 qualification is
equivalent to Masters level. 

Course pathway for Masters programme
Students can opt for Top-up MBA after studying Edexcel BTEC level 7
Extended Diploma in Strategic Management and Leadership online with us. 
The duration for Top-up MBA is usually around six months.

Please see Progression Pathways for further clarification.

